an></td></tr><tr class="hover:bg-ds-black-50/50 transition-colors border-b border-ds-black-200 bg-white"><th scope="row" class="px-6 py-4 text-ds-black-900 whitespace-nowrap">2030F</th><td class="px-6 py-4 text-ds-black-900 blur-sm">$<!-- -->3,199<!-- --> Mn</td><td class="px-6 py-4 blur-sm"><span class="text-ds-black-500">+<!-- -->5.4%</span></td><td class="px-6 py-4 text-ds-black-500 blur-sm">2.55</td><td class="px-6 py-4 text-ds-black-500 blur-sm">1,254.5</td><td class="px-6 py-4 blur-sm"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="flex-1 max-w-[120px]"><div class="w-full bg-ds-black-200 rounded-full h-1.5 overflow-hidden"><div class="h-full rounded-full transition-all duration-300 bg-ds-purple-500" style="width:80.89071390962634%"></div></div></div><span class="text-ds-black-500 text-sm min-w-[2.5rem]">$#%</span></div></td><td class="px-6 py-4 blur-sm"><span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs bg-ds-green-100 text-ds-green-700">Forecast</span></td></tr><tr class="hover:bg-ds-black-50/50 transition-colors  bg-white"><th scope="row" class="px-6 py-4 text-ds-black-900 whitespace-nowrap">2031F</th><td class="px-6 py-4 text-ds-black-900 blur-sm">$<!-- -->3,355<!-- --> Mn</td><td class="px-6 py-4 blur-sm"><span class="text-ds-black-500">+<!-- -->4.9%</span></td><td class="px-6 py-4 text-ds-black-500 blur-sm">2.63</td><td class="px-6 py-4 text-ds-black-500 blur-sm">1,275.7</td><td class="px-6 py-4 blur-sm"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="flex-1 max-w-[120px]"><div class="w-full bg-ds-black-200 rounded-full h-1.5 overflow-hidden"><div class="h-full rounded-full transition-all duration-300 bg-ds-purple-500" style="width:97.40453129660474%"></div></div></div><span class="text-ds-black-500 text-sm min-w-[2.5rem]">$#%</span></div></td><td class="px-6 py-4 blur-sm"><span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs bg-ds-green-100 text-ds-green-700">Forecast</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-8"><div class="border border-ds-black-200 bg-white rounded-md hover:shadow-brand-periwinkle transition-all duration-300"><div class="px-6 pt-6 pb-4 flex gap-4"><h3 class="text-base leading-relaxed text-black">Camera Volume</h3></div><div class="px-6 pb-6"><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-ds-black-500">2.15 million units, 2025, United States. Volume recovery improves retailer inventory turns and accessory attachment opportunities. Shipments to the wider Americas reached 2.35 million units in 2025, increasing 12.7% year over year.</p></div></div><div class="border border-ds-black-200 bg-white rounded-md hover:shadow-brand-periwinkle transition-all duration-300"><div class="px-6 pt-6 pb-4 flex gap-4"><h3 class="text-base leading-relaxed text-black">Blended ASP</h3></div><div class="px-6 pb-6"><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-ds-black-500">USD 1,125.6 per unit, 2025, United States. ASP resilience indicates that buyers prioritize sensor performance, lenses, video capability, and workflow reliability. Manufacturer shipment value to the Americas reached JPY 200.51 billion in 2025.</p></div></div><div class="border border-ds-black-200 bg-white rounded-md hover:shadow-brand-periwinkle transition-all duration-300"><div class="px-6 pt-6 pb-4 flex gap-4"><h3 class="text-base leading-relaxed text-black">Mirrorless Revenue Share</h3></div><div class="px-6 pb-6"><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-ds-black-500">68%, 2025, United States. Mirrorless concentration directs research, retail training, inventory, and lens investment toward fewer mounts. Global mirrorless shipments reached 6.31 million units in 2025, representing approximately 90% of interchangeable-lens camera shipments.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="segmentation" class="py-12 lg:py-12  bg-ds-black-50 "><div class="px-[16px] sm:px-10 lg:px-[40px] xl:px-[112.5px] max-w-7xl mx-auto"><div class="mb-16"><div class="mb-4"><h2 class="inline-flex font-dmsans items-center gap-2 text-sm uppercase tracking-widest font-bold text-ds-red-600">CHAPTER 6 - Segmentation</h2></div><h2 class="font-noto mt-2 tracking-tight text-[#171717] text-[25px] lg:text-[31.25px] font-medium">Market Segmentation Framework</h2><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-ds-black-500 mt-6 max-w-3xl">Comprehensive analysis across key dimensions providing insights into market structure, buyer requirements, product economics, technology adoption, channel strategy, and geographic demand concentration.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:flex md:items-baseline gap-6 md:gap-8 lg:gap-8 pt-10 mt-10 border-t border-ds-black-200"><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-[10px] bg-white border border-ds-black-200 hover:shadow-[0_10px_15px_-3px_rgba(109,82,217,0.1),0_4px_6px_-4px_rgba(109,82,217,0.08)] transition-shadow duration-300"><div class="flex flex-col"><p class="text-[14px] text-ds-black-600">No of Segments</p><p class="text-[18px] font-bold text-ds-black-900">7</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-[10px] bg-white border border-ds-black-200 hover:shadow-[0_10px_15px_-3px_rgba(109,82,217,0.1),0_4px_6px_-4px_rgba(109,82,217,0.08)] transition-shadow duration-300"><div class="flex flex-col"><p class="text-[14px] text-ds-black-600">Dominant Segment</p><p class="text-[18px] font-bold text-ds-black-900">Product Type</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-[10px] bg-white border border-ds-black-200 hover:shadow-[0_10px_15px_-3px_rgba(109,82,217,0.1),0_4px_6px_-4px_rgba(109,82,217,0.08)] transition-shadow duration-300"><div class="flex flex-col"><p class="text-[14px] text-ds-black-600">Fastest Growing Segment</p><p class="text-[18px] font-bold text-ds-black-900">Technology</p></div></div></div></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-6"><div class="h-full p-4 bg-white border border-ds-black-200 rounded-md hover:shadow-brand-purple transition-shadow duration-300"><div class="flex gap-4 items-center mb-4"><div class="