"text-sm font-bold text-ds-black-900 ml-2 blur-sm">$<!-- -->%</span></div><div class="w-full bg-ds-black-100 rounded-full h-2 overflow-hidden blur-[3px]"><div class="h-full rounded-full transition-all duration-700 ease-out bg-ds-purple-300" style="width:NaN%"></div></div></div><div><div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2"><div class="flex-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-sm text-ds-black-900">Online Marketplaces</span></div></div><span class="text-sm font-bold text-ds-black-900 ml-2 blur-sm">$<!-- -->%</span></div><div class="w-full bg-ds-black-100 rounded-full h-2 overflow-hidden blur-[3px]"><div class="h-full rounded-full transition-all duration-700 ease-out bg-ds-purple-300" style="width:NaN%"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="h-full p-4 bg-white border border-ds-black-200 rounded-md hover:shadow-brand-purple transition-shadow duration-300"><div class="flex gap-4 items-center mb-4"><div class="size-10  rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center bg-ds-purple-100"><div class="text-ds-purple-500"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="text-[var(--purple-500)]"><path d="M216,80H184V48a16,16,0,0,0-16-16H40A16,16,0,0,0,24,48V176a8,8,0,0,0,13,6.22L72,154V184a16,16,0,0,0,16,16h93.59L219,230.22a8,8,0,0,0,5,1.78,8,8,0,0,0,8-8V96A16,16,0,0,0,216,80ZM66.55,137.78,40,159.25V48H168v88H71.58A8,8,0,0,0,66.55,137.78ZM216,207.25l-26.55-21.47a8,8,0,0,0-5-1.78H88V152h80a16,16,0,0,0,16-16V96h32Z"></path></svg></div></div><h3 class="text-lg text-ds-black-900 mb-1">Geography</h3></div><div class="space-y-4 mt-6"><div><div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2"><div class="flex-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-sm text-ds-black-900">West</span></div></div><span class="text-sm font-bold text-ds-black-900 ml-2 blur-sm">$<!-- -->%</span></div><div class="w-full bg-ds-black-100 rounded-full h-2 overflow-hidden blur-[3px]"><div class="h-full rounded-full transition-all duration-700 ease-out bg-ds-purple-300" style="width:NaN%"></div></div></div><div><div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2"><div class="flex-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-sm text-ds-black-900">South</span></div></div><span class="text-sm font-bold text-ds-black-900 ml-2 blur-sm">$<!-- -->%</span></div><div class="w-full bg-ds-black-100 rounded-full h-2 overflow-hidden blur-[3px]"><div class="h-full rounded-full transition-all duration-700 ease-out bg-ds-purple-300" style="width:NaN%"></div></div></div><div><div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2"><div class="flex-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-sm text-ds-black-900">Northeast</span></div></div><span class="text-sm font-bold text-ds-black-900 ml-2 blur-sm">$<!-- -->%</span></div><div class="w-full bg-ds-black-100 rounded-full h-2 overflow-hidden blur-[3px]"><div class="h-full rounded-full transition-all duration-700 ease-out bg-ds-purple-300" style="width:NaN%"></div></div></div><div><div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2"><div class="flex-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-sm text-ds-black-900">Midwest</span></div></div><span class="text-sm font-bold text-ds-black-900 ml-2 blur-sm">$<!-- -->%</span></div><div class="w-full bg-ds-black-100 rounded-full h-2 overflow-hidden blur-[3px]"><div class="h-full rounded-full transition-all duration-700 ease-out bg-ds-purple-300" style="width:NaN%"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-slot="card" class="bg-white border border-ds-border-default hover:shadow-brand-purple transition-shadow duration-[300ms] ease-in-out mt-12 rounded-md" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(243, 244, 255, 0.5), rgba(250, 250, 250, 0.3));border-color:rgba(226, 228, 253, 0.5);border-width:1px"><div data-slot="card-content" class="[&amp;:last-child]:pb-4 p-4"><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-6"><div><h3 class="text-lg text-ds-black-900 mb-1">Key Segmentation Takeaways</h3><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-ds-black-500 mt-4 max-w-3xl">Comprehensive analysis across all extracted segmentation dimensions provides insight into how camera value is created through product specialization, professional use cases, differentiated sensor platforms, premium pricing, service-intensive channels, and regional creator clusters.</p></div></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6"><div class="p-4 bg-white border border--ds-black-200 rounded-md"><h4 class="text-base text-ds-black-900 mb-2">Product Type</h4><p class="text-sm text-ds-black-500">Product architecture is the primary revenue-allocation dimension because camera bodies differ materially in selling price, lens attachment, replacement frequency, and user purpose. Mirrorless cameras dominate through broader professional and enthusiast adoption, while premium fixed-lens cameras provide renewed scarcity-led demand. DSLR value continues to contract, and action or 360-degree systems serve narrower but defensible outdoor and creator applications.</p></div><div class="p-4 bg-white border border--ds-black-200 rounded-md"><h4 class="text-base text-ds-black-900 mb-2">Technology</h4><p class="text-sm text-ds-black-500">Technology is the fastest-growing dimension as purchase decisions increasingly depend on subject-recognition autofocus, stabilized sensors, high-resolution video, automated framing, wireless transfer, and mobile workflow integration. AI-assisted imaging systems are expected to expand most rapidly because they improve keeper rates and reduce production effort for creators, event photographers, sports users, and small media teams without requiring equivalent increases in specialist operating skill.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="regional" class="bg-white"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto py-12 lg:py-12"><div class="mx-auto px-[16px] lg:px-[112.5px]"><div class="mb-16"><div class="mb-4"><h2 class="inline-flex font-dmsans items-center gap-2 text-sm uppercase tracking-widest font-bold text-ds-red-600">CHAPTER 7 - Regional Analysis</h2></div><h2 class="font-serif tracking-tight textds-black-900 text-[25px] lg:text-[31.25px] font-medium">Regional Analysis</h2><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-ds-black-500 mt-4 max-w-3xl">The United States ranks first among selected economically relevant digital-camera markets, supported by high creator spending, strong specialist retail, premium product mix, and significant professional-media demand. Japan retains the strongest domestic production ecosystem, while China offers a larger growth runway from lower per-capita dedicated-camera penetration. Estimates apply a consistent V02 retail-market lens to CIPA shipment indicators and population benchmarks.</p><div class="pt-10 mt-10 border-t border-ds-black-200"><div class="hidden md:flex items-baseline gap-8 "><div class="flex items-baseline gap-10 lg:gap-14"><div class="flex flex-col"><p class="text-[14px] text-ds-black-600">Focus Country Ranking</p><p class="text-[26px] font-bold text-ds-black-900">1st</p></div><div class="w-px h-8 bg-[#d4d4d4] self-center"></div></div><div class="flex items-baseline gap-10 lg:gap-14"><div class="flex flex-col"><p class="text-[14px] text-ds-black-600">Focus Country Market Size</p><p class="text-[26px] font-bold text-ds-black-900">USD 2.42 Bn (2025)</p></div><div class="w-px h-8 bg-[#d4d4d4] self-center"></div></div><div class="flex items-baseline gap-10 lg:gap-14"><div class="flex flex-col"><p class="text-[14px] text-ds-black-600">USA CAGR (2026-2031)</p><p class="text-[26px] font-bold text-ds-black-900">5.6%</p></div></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-6 md:hidden "><div class="text-center"><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center"><p class="text-[14px] text-ds-black-600">Focus Country Ranking</p><p class="text-[22px] font-bold text-ds-black-900">1st</p></div></div><div class="text-center"><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center"><p class="text-[14px] text-ds-black-600">Focus Country Market Size</p><p class="text-[22px] font-bold text-ds-black-900">USD 2.42 Bn (2025)</p></div></div><div class="text-center"><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center"><p class="text-[14px] text-ds-black-600">USA CAGR (2026-2031)</p><p class="text-[22px] font-bold text-ds-black-900">5.6%</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 w-full lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6 lg:gap-8 mb-6 lg:mb-8 mx-2"><div data-slot="card" class="bg-white rounded-md border border-ds-border-default hover:shadow-brand-purple transition-shadow duration-[300ms] ease-in-out"><div data-slot="card-header" class="@container/card-header grid auto-rows-min grid-rows-[auto_auto] items-start gap-1.5 px-6 pt-6 pb-4 has-data-[slot=card-action]:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] [.border-b]:pb-6"><h3 data-slot="card-title" class="leading-none">Regional Analysis (Current Year)</h3></div><div data-slot="card-content" class="px-6 [&amp;:last-child]:pb-4"><!--$!--><template data-dgst="BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING"></template><div class="w-full animate-pulse rounded-lg bg-ds-black-100" style="height:380px"></div><!--/$--></div></div><div class="border border-ds-black-200 bg-white rounded-md hover:shadow-brand-periwinkle transition-all duration-300"><div class="px-6 pt-6 pb-4 flex gap-4"><h3 class="text-base leading-relaxed text-black">Regional Analysis Comparison</h3></div><div class="px-6 pb-6"><div class="relative w-full overflow-auto"><table class="w-full caption-bottom text-sm"><thead class="[&amp;_tr]:border-b"><tr class="border-b transition-colors hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted"><th class="h-12 px-4 text-left align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-[14px] font-[700] text-ds-black-900">Metric</th><th class="h-12 px-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-[14px] font-[700] text-ds-black-900 text-center">United States</th><th class="h-12 px-4 align-middle [&amp;:has(